the createPortal allows us to create a an 
invicible portal from the place where the 
component is in the component tree to another 
place in the dom tree. So basically only the 
dom location is affected with the createPortal function

in this case the Modal component is still a 
child element of the AddCabin component 
but the location in the dom is changed 


the main reason why a portal becomes necessary is 
to avoid conflit with the css property Overflow set to hidden 

